        <div class="after"><span>{t('后来误用：Stage 2 gate', 'Later misuse: Stage-2 gate')}</span><strong>{t('每 256 次 rollout 不到 8 个身份就不更新', 'no update unless a 256-rollout window reaches 8 identities')}</strong><p>{t('实际窗口最多只有 7 个 qualifying identities；于是 20,480 次 rollout 和 797 条 positive 轨迹，仍然得到 0 次参数更新。', 'A real window topped out at 7 qualifying identities; thus 20,480 rollouts and 797 positive trajectories still produced zero parameter updates.')}</p></div>
