  <section id="directapply" class="briefing-slide tone-green" aria-labelledby="directapply-title">
    <div class="slide-inner directapply-slide">
      <h2 id="directapply-title">{t('DirectApply 只改一件事：不再让短期 probe 二次否决', 'DirectApply changes one thing: the short probe no longer gets a second veto')}</h2>
      <p class="slide-thesis">{t('冻结起点、任务/数据条件和 SD-LoRA 训练规则尽量保持一致。GDR-v1 会在候选训练完成后再做一次 16-task task-score probe；DirectApply 让通过共同数据、工程和重复性合同的候选直接进入下一轮。这样主要 treatment change 就只剩“短期 probe 有没有二次否决权”。', 'Frozen start, task/data conditions, and the SD-LoRA training rule stay matched as closely as possible. GDR-v1 adds a 16-task task-score probe after candidate training; DirectApply sends candidates that pass the shared data, engineering, and repeatability contracts directly into the next state. The main treatment change is whether the short probe has a second veto.')}</p>
      <div class="before-after">
        <div class="before"><span>GDR</span><strong>{t('候选 → 16-task probe → 接受 / 拒绝', 'candidate → 16-task probe → accept / reject')}</strong><p>{t('probe 的短期 task score 决定这次已经训练好的 SD-LoRA 候选是否进入下一轮。', 'The short probe task score decides whether the already-trained SD-LoRA candidate enters the next state.')}</p></div>
        <div class="after"><span>DirectApply</span><strong>{t('候选 → 共同合同通过 → 直接进入下一轮', 'candidate → shared contracts pass → enter next state')}</strong><p>{t('候选仍需通过共同的数据、工程与重复性合同；通过后直接应用，不再由短期 task-score probe 做第二次否决。', 'The candidate still passes the shared data, engineering, and repeatability contracts; once those pass, it is applied without a second task-score veto.')}</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="plain-language-result"><strong>{t('现在已经有运行中证据', 'The comparison now has live running evidence')}</strong><p>{t('No-GDR / DirectApply 已经持续长跑；下一页只展示一个带时间戳的 live snapshot。冻结终评仍未打开，所以开场结果表继续保持空白。', 'No-GDR / DirectApply is now well into its long run; the next slide shows only a timestamped live snapshot. The frozen final is still unopened, so the opening result table remains blank.')}</p></div>
      <p class="source-note"><a href={technicalHref}>{t('冻结起点、treatment identity、seed 与 determinism 证据', 'Frozen start, treatment identity, seeds, and determinism evidence')}</a></p>
      <p class="slide-number">18 / 22</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section id="directapply-progress" class="briefing-slide tone-green" aria-labelledby="directapply-progress-title">
    <div class="slide-inner dynamics-slide experiment-dynamics directapply-dynamics">
      <h2 id="directapply-progress-title">{t('DirectApply 前期抬高了分数，最近进入震荡平台', 'DirectApply improved early, then entered a noisy plateau')}</h2>
      <p class="slide-thesis">{t(`这是 2026-09-10 09:52 SGT 的运行中快照。R0–R97 已经封口，共 ${dynamicsDirectApply.sealedRounds} 轮 / ${dynamicsDirectApply.formalRollouts.toLocaleString('en-US')} 次正式 rollout。这里和 7B、3B、1.7B GDR 一样，用左侧 Score 图和右侧 SD-LoRA loss 图展示训练过程；冻结终评仍未打开，DirectApply 的最终 Score / Succ. 继续保持空白。`, `This is a live snapshot at 2026-09-10 09:52 SGT. R0–R97 are sealed, with ${dynamicsDirectApply.sealedRounds} rounds / ${dynamicsDirectApply.formalRollouts.toLocaleString('en-US')} formal rollouts. Like the 7B, 3B, and 1.7B GDR slides, this uses the left Score chart and right SD-LoRA loss chart to show training dynamics; the frozen final remains unopened, and DirectApply final Score / Succ. remains blank.`)}</p>
      <div class="dynamics-grid">
        <figure class="dynamics-chart score-chart">
          <figcaption>{t('训练过程中每轮 WebShop Score', 'WebShop Score during training')} <span>{t('细线=原始轮次；粗线=12轮移动平均；底部短线=SD-LoRA 候选', 'thin=raw rounds; thick=12-round moving average; bottom ticks=SD-LoRA candidates')}</span></figcaption>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 700 248" role="img" aria-label={t('DirectApply 每轮 WebShop Score 与移动平均曲线', 'DirectApply WebShop Score and moving-average curve by round')}>
            <line x1="42" y1="220" x2="676" y2="220" class="chart-axis" /><line x1="42" y1="118" x2="676" y2="118" class="chart-gridline" /><line x1="42" y1="16" x2="676" y2="16" class="chart-gridline" />
            <text x="14" y="224" class="chart-label">0</text><text x="8" y="122" class="chart-label">40</text><text x="8" y="20" class="chart-label">80</text>
            <text x="42" y="242" class="chart-label">R0</text><text x="350" y="242" class="chart-label">R49</text><text x="646" y="242" class="chart-label">R97</text>
            <polyline points={scoreRawPointsDirectApply} class="score-raw" /><polyline points={scoreTrendPointsDirectApply} class="score-trend" />
            {directApplyCandidateRounds.map((round) => <line x1={scoreXDirectApply(round)} x2={scoreXDirectApply(round)} y1="220" y2="228" class="candidate-tick" />)}
