        </figure>
        <figure class="dynamics-chart loss-chart">
          <figcaption>{t('SD-LoRA training loss', 'SD-LoRA training loss')} <span>{t('每个点=DirectApply 已采用的候选更新', 'each point=one candidate admitted by DirectApply')}</span></figcaption>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 360 248" role="img" aria-label={t('DirectApply 已采用 SD-LoRA 候选的 training loss 曲线', 'Training loss for SD-LoRA candidates admitted by DirectApply')}>
            <line x1="36" y1="220" x2="340" y2="220" class="chart-axis" /><line x1="36" y1="118" x2="340" y2="118" class="chart-gridline" /><line x1="36" y1="16" x2="340" y2="16" class="chart-gridline" />
            <text x="4" y="224" class="chart-label">0</text><text x="4" y="122" class="chart-label">0.55</text><text x="4" y="20" class="chart-label">1.10</text><text x="36" y="242" class="chart-label">R0</text><text x="310" y="242" class="chart-label">R97</text>
            <polyline points={lossPointsDirectApply} class="loss-line" />{dynamicsDirectApply.loss.map((point) => <circle cx={lossXDirectApply(point.round)} cy={lossYDirectApply(point.loss)} r="2.4" class="loss-dot accepted" />)}
          </svg>
        </figure>
      </div>
      <div class="experiment-strip"><span><strong>{dynamicsDirectApply.sealedRounds} rounds · {dynamicsDirectApply.formalRollouts.toLocaleString('en-US')}</strong>{t('已封口训练进度', 'sealed training progress')}</span><span><strong>{dynamicsDirectApply.directApplyAdmissions} / {dynamicsDirectApply.sdLoraCandidatesTrained}</strong>{t(' 候选全部进入后续模型', ' candidates entered later states')}</span><span><strong>{dynamicsDirectApply.shadowGdrPass} pass · {dynamicsDirectApply.shadowGdrReject} reject</strong>{t(' shadow GDR 只做诊断标签', ' shadow GDR labels only')}</span><span><strong>{firstLossDirectApply.toFixed(3)} → {lastLossDirectApply.toFixed(3)}</strong>{t(' SD-LoRA training loss', ' SD-LoRA training loss')}</span></div>
      <p class="dynamics-boundary"><strong>{t('曲线怎么读：', 'How to read the curves:')}</strong>{t(`前 20 个已封口 round 的平均 Score 是 ${earlyScoreMeanDirectApply.toFixed(2)}，最近 20 个是 ${lateScoreMeanDirectApply.toFixed(2)}，相对起点有抬高；但 R70–79 / R80–89 / R90–97 的均值是 58.35 → 55.36 → 50.83，最近进入震荡平台。shadow GDR 的 pass / reject 只是给 DirectApply 路径产生的候选打诊断标签，没有运行一条完整 GDR 反事实轨迹。冻结 final panel 仍未打开。`, `Mean Score is ${earlyScoreMeanDirectApply.toFixed(2)} over the first 20 sealed rounds and ${lateScoreMeanDirectApply.toFixed(2)} over the latest 20, showing improvement relative to the start; R70–79 / R80–89 / R90–97 then average 58.35 → 55.36 → 50.83, indicating a noisy plateau. Shadow-GDR pass/reject values are diagnostic labels on candidates produced along the DirectApply path; they are not a separately executed full GDR counterfactual trajectory. The frozen final panel remains unopened.`)}</p>
      <p class="source-note"><a href={directApplyLiveSnapshotHref}>{t('09:52 SGT 可审计快照', '09:52 SGT auditable snapshot')}</a> · <a href={directApplyLiveAuthorityHref} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><ExternalBrandMark href={directApplyLiveAuthorityHref} /> {t('当前 No-GDR controller · 911e3afe', 'current No-GDR controller · 911e3afe')}</a></p>
      <p class="slide-number">19 / 22</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section id="directapply-plateau" class="briefing-slide tone-gold" aria-labelledby="directapply-plateau-title">
    <div class="slide-inner directapply-plateau-slide">
      <h2 id="directapply-plateau-title">{t('R70 以后 Score 进入震荡平台，训练和参数更新仍在继续', 'After R70, Score enters a noisy plateau while training and parameter updates continue')}</h2>
      <p class="slide-thesis">{t('到 R97，97 个 SD-LoRA 候选都已经实际进入下一轮，training loss 也从 1.046 降到 0.107。优化过程仍在继续；新的问题是：为什么这些参数更新越来越难稳定换成 WebShop 分数。下面三项都只是用来生成下一条假设的诊断现象。', 'By R97, all 97 trained SD-LoRA candidates have entered later states, while training loss fell from 1.046 to 0.107. Optimization is still continuing; the question is why those parameter updates are becoming harder to translate into stable WebShop gains. The three observations below are hypothesis-generating diagnostics only.')}</p>
      <div class="plateau-grid">
        <article><span>01 · {t('训练仍在继续', 'training continues')}</span><strong>58.35 → 55.36 → 50.83</strong><p>{t('这是 R70–79、R80–89、R90–97 的平均 Score。曲线在抖，最近一段还往下走；这叫平台期，比“训练卡死”更准确。', 'These are the mean Scores for R70–79, R80–89, and R90–97. The curve is noisy and the latest block is lower; plateau is the better description than a stopped run.')}</p></article>
        <article><span>02 · {t('学习材料偏向会做的题', 'training data favors solved tasks')}</span><strong>94 / 98 rounds</strong><p>{t('有 94 轮里，进入 SD-LoRA 的 task 数和 clean exact-success task 数完全相同；最近 20 轮平均只有 8.25 / 16 个 task 进入训练。会做的题持续强化，真正难题更难产生新监督。', 'In 94 of 98 rounds, the number of tasks selected for SD-LoRA exactly matches the clean exact-success task count. Only 8.25 of 16 tasks enter training on average over the latest 20 rounds, so already-solved tasks keep supplying most of the supervision.')}</p></article>
        <article><span>03 · {t('新更新开始互相拉扯', 'new updates pull in different directions')}</span><strong>cos ≈ −0.046</strong><p>{t('最近 10 次相邻参数更新的平均方向相似度接近 0 且略负，其中 7 / 10 为负；同一批候选的 shadow GDR 只有 3 / 10 会通过。它提示更新变得不稳定，但还不能据此宣布 GDR 或 DirectApply 胜出。', 'Across the latest 10 updates, adjacent parameter-direction cosine averages about −0.046 and is negative in 7 of 10 cases; shadow GDR would pass only 3 of those 10 candidates. This flags unstable update directions, without establishing a GDR or DirectApply winner.')}</p></article>
      </div>
      <div class="plateau-carriers"><span><strong>SD-LoRA · 97</strong>{t(' 次更新', ' updates')}</span><span><strong>Text Memory · 2</strong>{t(' 次更新', ' updates')}</span><span><strong>Agent System · 1</strong>{t(' 次更新', ' update')}</span><span><strong>Skill · 1</strong>{t(' 次更新', ' update')}</span></div>
      <p class="plateau-decision"><strong>{t('现在怎么做', 'Decision now')}</strong>{t('这些相关性让我们优先怀疑“学习材料越来越窄 / 更新方向越来越不一致”，还没有锁定平台的因果原因。当前 DirectApply 按冻结合同原样跑完 R160；successor 保持相同 128-rollout 总预算，只把更多探索机会给 high-partial-reward / hard tasks。若仍平台，再单独测试 partial-credit / preference learning。', 'These correlations prioritize a hypothesis around narrowing learning material and less-consistent update directions; they do not identify the plateau cause. Keep the current DirectApply treatment unchanged through R160. A successor keeps the same 128-rollout budget and changes only exploration allocation toward high-partial-reward / hard tasks. If it still plateaus, test partial-credit / preference learning separately.')}</p>
      <p class="source-note"><a href={directApplyPlateauEvidenceHref}>{t('10:38 SGT 平台期诊断快照', '10:38 SGT plateau diagnostic')}</a> · <span>{t('诊断用于提出下一条假设；冻结 final panel access = 0', 'diagnostic for successor design; frozen final panel access = 0')}</span></p>
      <p class="slide-number">20 / 22</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section id="technical-work-summary" class="briefing-slide tone-paper" aria-labelledby="technical-work-title">
    <div class="slide-inner summary-slide tech-summary-slide">
      <h2 id="technical-work-title">{t('我们做过哪些技术工作', 'Engineering work behind the experiments')}</h2>
      <p class="slide-thesis">{t('这些技术工作分别保护一种实验性质：知道结果来自哪份代码、确认两组真的只差一个变量、机器中断后不重跑，以及加速时不偷偷改变科学语义。', 'Each engineering layer protects a different experimental property: knowing exactly which code produced a result, keeping comparisons one-variable, resuming without replay, and speeding up without silently changing scientific semantics.')}</p>
      <ol class="technical-proof-grid">
        <li><span>01</span><div><strong>{t('为了可追溯', 'Traceability')}</strong><p>{t('每次运行绑定 Git commit SHA、config / payload SHA256、W&B run identity 和 ledger receipt。拿到一个数字，可以一路追到实际代码与数据。', 'Bind every run to a Git commit SHA, config / payload SHA256, W&B run identity, and ledger receipts so a number can be traced back to its code and data.')}</p></div></li>
        <li><span>02</span><div><strong>{t('为了公平比较', 'Causal comparability')}</strong><p>{t('冻结起点、seed、任务顺序和 treatment identity；固定 GPU 的 determinism 检查用于确认重复执行不会把硬件漂移误当成方法差异。', 'Freeze starts, seeds, task order, and treatment identity; fixed-GPU determinism checks prevent hardware drift from masquerading as a method difference.')}</p></div></li>
        <li><span>03</span><div><strong>{t('为了中断后还能原地继续', 'Recoverability')}</strong><p>{t('Checkpoint、archive、transaction receipt、resume / recovery 连在一起；恢复前核对 state SHA，避免把已经完成的 rollout 再消费一次。', 'Checkpoint, archive, transaction receipts, resume, and recovery are chained together; state SHAs are checked before recovery so completed rollouts are not consumed twice.')}</p></div></li>
        <li><span>04</span><div><strong>{t('为了排除动作接口这个隐藏变量', 'Action-interface validity')}</strong><p>{t('Harness、parser、ActionPrefixConstraint 和 injective action encoding 把“模型不会做”与“动作格式坏了”分开。', 'Harness, parser, ActionPrefixConstraint, and injective action encoding separate model failure from a broken action interface.')}</p></div></li>
        <li><span>05</span><div><strong>{t('为了长跑不被实现细节卡住', 'Long-run continuity')}</strong><p>{t('SD-LoRA component capacity 做单独资格验证；解除 64-component 工程上限时保持其他实验合同不动。', 'Qualify SD-LoRA component capacity separately; remove the 64-component implementation cap while leaving the rest of the experiment contract unchanged.')}</p></div></li>
        <li><span>06</span><div><strong>{t('为了加速但不改科学语义', 'Safe speedup')}</strong><p>{t('Ray 多模型并行、resource-only handoff 和 formal rollout replay = 0 的恢复检查，让 GPU 调度可以优化，同时保留同一实验身份。', 'Ray multi-model parallelism, resource-only handoffs, and formal-rollout-replay = 0 checks let scheduling improve while preserving the same scientific identity.')}</p></div></li>
      </ol>
      <p class="source-note"><a href={technicalHref}>{t('查看完整技术证据', 'Open the full technical evidence')}</a></p>
      <p class="slide-number">21 / 22</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section id="next" class="briefing-slide briefing-final" aria-labelledby="next-title">
    <div class="slide-inner">
      <h2 id="next-title">{t('DirectApply 先按原合同跑完 R160；下一条实验只改学习材料的选择', 'Finish DirectApply unchanged through R160; the next experiment changes only learning-material selection')}</h2>
      <p class="slide-thesis">{t('当前这条 DirectApply 长跑中途不再换采样、奖励或准入规则，保证平台期和后续变化都属于同一个 treatment。下一条 successor 再单独改变探索机会分配；这样每次仍然只回答一个问题。', 'Do not change sampling, reward, or admission rules midway through the current DirectApply long run, so the plateau and any later changes remain within one treatment. A separate successor then changes exploration allocation only, keeping each experiment focused on one question.')}</p>
      <div class="choice-grid">
        <div class="choice current-line"><span>{t('当前线', 'CURRENT RUN')}</span><h3>{t('DirectApply 原样跑到 R160', 'Run DirectApply unchanged through R160')}</h3><p>{t('保留 clean long-horizon evidence。训练结束前 final panel 继续锁住，live round Score 也不升级成最终 benchmark 成绩。', 'Preserve clean long-horizon evidence. The final panel stays locked until training ends, and live round Score is not promoted to a final benchmark result.')}</p></div>
        <div class="choice successor-line"><span>{t('下一条实验', 'SUCCESSOR')}</span><h3>{t('把更多探索机会给“差一点就会”的难题', 'Give more exploration to hard tasks that are close to success')}</h3><p>{t('保持相同 128-rollout 总预算，只改变哪些任务更容易获得新探索：优先 high-partial-reward / hard tasks。若仍平台，再把 partial-credit 或 preference learning 各自做成新的单变量实验。', 'Keep the same 128-rollout budget and change only which tasks receive more exploration, prioritizing high-partial-reward / hard tasks. If the plateau remains, test partial-credit or preference learning as separate one-variable treatments.')}</p></div>
      </div>
      <p class="final-source"><a href={flowHref}>{t('实验流程', 'Experiment flow')}</a> · <a href={technicalHref}>{t('技术推导与实验严谨性', 'Technical derivations and rigor')}</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</article>

<script is:inline>
  const syncBriefingScale = () => {
    const deck = document.querySelector('[data-testid="progress-briefing"]');
    if (!(deck instanceof HTMLElement)) return;
    const availableWidth = Math.min(1280, deck.clientWidth);
    const scale = availableWidth / 1280;
    deck.style.setProperty('--deck-scale', String(scale));
    deck.style.setProperty('--scaled-deck-w', `${availableWidth}px`);
    deck.style.setProperty('--scaled-deck-h', `${720 * scale}px`);
  };
  syncBriefingScale();
  window.addEventListener('resize', syncBriefingScale, { passive: true });
  window.visualViewport?.addEventListener('resize', syncBriefingScale, { passive: true });
</script>

